<title>USA: British Sky Broadcasting sets $300 mln notes.</title>
<headline>British Sky Broadcasting sets $300 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was</p>
<p>priced of Thursday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp;</p>
<p>Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER BRITISH SKY BROADCASTING GROUP PLC</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN		 COUPON 7.30 PCT   MATURITY 10/15/06</p>
<p>TYPE GUARANTEED NOTES    ISS PRICE 99.829  FIRST PAY N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BAA2	    YIELD 7.324 PCT   PAY FREQ  N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS	 SPREAD 80 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>THE NOTES ARE GUARANTEED BY BRITISH SKY LTD AND SKY</p>
<p>SUBSCRIBERS SERVICES LTD.</p>
<p>--U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1678</p>
